    "description": "<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:2em; border:2px solid #999; font-size:105%; text-align:center; background:#00008B;\">\n <tbody>\n  <tr>\n   <td><i><b>This <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Homebrew_Content\" title=\"Homebrew Content\">Homebrew Content</a> has been <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Tested\" title=\"Category:Tested\">Tested</a> per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Category:Untested\" title=\"Category:Untested\">Untested</a> guidelines. Whether or not it can be used is, as always, the prerogative of the Gamemaster.</b></i></td>\n  </tr>\n </tbody>\n</table><p><i>Micro Vision Feat data created by Wikia user Darthauthor.</i></p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Feats\" title=\"Feats\">Feats</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Species_Feats\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Species Feats\">Species Feats</a></i></p><p>You are able to focus to 0.07 on the Gandok Scale, and can see microscopic details of nearby objects.</p><p><b>Prerequisite:</b> <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Bith\" title=\"Bith\">Bith</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Octeroid\" title=\"Octeroid\">Octeroid</a>, <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Roonan\" title=\"Roonan\">Roonan</a>, or <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Verpine\" title=\"Verpine\">Verpine</a></p><p><b>Effect:</b> When using the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Search\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Search\">Search</a> application of the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> skill you get a +10 circumstance bonus if you are within 5 meters (3 Squares).</p>",
